# A Today entry moved to the top and then renamed in place stays at the top after quitting and reopening.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
	- Pay rent @due({today})
END
keys gt G <A-k> <A-k> <Enter>
type  online
keys <Esc>
restart
see 󰖙 Today
keys gg x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @due({today})
	- Review PRs @due({today})
	- Pay rent online @due({today}) @done({today})
END
